      "writtenOn": "2026-01-09T05:55:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Perhaps worth a mention that even though it\u0027s possible to do `buffer.MapSync` after dropping the device (and thus dropping the instance), that\u0027s OK because [doing so destroys the device](https://webgpu-native.github.io/webgpu-headers/Ownership.html#DeviceRelease).\n\nIncidentally we don\u0027t mention there that dropping the Instance has special behavior, so we don\u0027t need to update that. But we should tweak the language there because I think Device will now be the _only_ object with special behavior on drop, not just the only _destroyable_ object.",
      "range": {
